IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DataDivisionDemo.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CUSTOMER-FILE ASSIGN TO "CUSTOMER.DAT"
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS CUST-ID.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  CUSTOMER-FILE.
01  CUSTOMER-RECORD.
    05  CUST-ID           PIC 9(6).
    05  CUST-NAME          PIC X(30).
    05  CUST-BALANCE       PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-COUNTERS.
    05  WS-TOTAL-COUNT     PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
    05  WS-INDEX           PIC 9(4) COMP.
01  WS-FLAGS.
    05  WS-EOF-FLAG        PIC X VALUE "N".
        88  WS-EOF               VALUE "Y".
        88  WS-NOT-EOF           VALUE "N".
01  WS-TABLE.
    05  WS-ENTRY OCCURS 10 TIMES INDEXED BY WS-IDX.
        10  WS-ENTRY-NAME  PIC X(20).
        10  WS-ENTRY-AMT   PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-REDEFINED-GROUP.
    05  WS-NUMERIC-VIEW    PIC 9(8).
01  WS-ALIAS REDEFINES WS-REDEFINED-GROUP.
    05  WS-CHAR-VIEW       PIC X(8).
01  WS-DATE-FIELDS.
    05  WS-YEAR            PIC 9(4).
    05  WS-MONTH           PIC 99.
    05  WS-DAY             PIC 99.
01  WS-SIGNED-EDITED       PIC +9(5).99 JUSTIFIED RIGHT.
01  WS-CONSTANT-VALUE      PIC X(9) VALUE "CONSTANT!".

LINKAGE SECTION.
01  LS-PARAMETER            PIC X(10).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-PARAMETER.
MAIN-PARAGRAPH.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-INDEX.
    DISPLAY "Data division demo".
    STOP RUN.
